{"id":"390383982043afea","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-geometric-formula-induction.md","title":"Theorem — 几何公式的构造归纳","display":"Theorem — 几何公式的构造归纳","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-geometric-formula-induction","aliases":["14-thm-geometric-formula-induction"],"display":"Theorem — 几何公式的构造归纳","depends_on":["[[14-df-finitary-geometric-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-geometric-formula-induction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-geometric-formula-induction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 几何公式的构造归纳"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"99e83f097dc38c76\" href=\"?note=99e83f097dc38c76\" title=\"14-df-finitary-geometric-formula\">14-df-finitary-geometric-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"99e83f097dc38c76\" href=\"?note=99e83f097dc38c76\" title=\"14-df-finitary-geometric-formula\">14-df-finitary-geometric-formula</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S\">\\(P\\subseteq\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_S\">\\(A_S\\)</span> 是原子基例集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl[A_S\\subseteq P\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in P\\ (\\varphi\\wedge\\psi\\in P\\land\\varphi\\vee\\psi\\in P)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in P\\ \\forall x\\in\\operatorname{Var}_S\\ (\\exists x\\,\\varphi)\\in P\\bigr]\\Rightarrow P=\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl[A_S\\subseteq P\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in P\\ (\\varphi\\wedge\\psi\\in P\\land\\varphi\\vee\\psi\\in P)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in P\\ \\forall x\\in\\operatorname{Var}_S\\ (\\exists x\\,\\varphi)\\in P\\bigr]\\Rightarrow P=\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：对 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"99e83f097dc38c76\" href=\"?note=99e83f097dc38c76\" title=\"14-df-finitary-geometric-formula\">14-df-finitary-geometric-formula</a> 的有限阶段 n 归纳得 G_S^n⊆P，再取并；反向包含为假设。旧稿仅重复成员资格定义，现提供真正用于 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f2895e14ad640cde\" href=\"?note=f2895e14ad640cde\" title=\"14-thm-geometric-formula-inverse-image-invariance\">14-thm-geometric-formula-inverse-image-invariance</a> 等证明的构造归纳原理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-finitary-geometric-formula","status":"resolved","id":"99e83f097dc38c76","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-finitary-geometric-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-finitary-geometric-formula","status":"resolved","id":"99e83f097dc38c76","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S$ 采用 [[14-df-finitary-geometric-formula]]；$P\\subseteq\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S$，$A_S$ 是原子基例集合。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-finitary-geometric-formula","status":"resolved","id":"99e83f097dc38c76","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"证明：对 [[14-df-finitary-geometric-formula]] 的有限阶段 n 归纳得 G_S^n⊆P，再取并；反向包含为假设。旧稿仅重复成员资格定义，现提供真正用于 [[14-thm-geometric-formula-inverse-image-invariance]] 等证明的构造归纳原理。","embed"